    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159860/extras/c797fa8882eadd5f0d81d5e7f964ac32.poster.avif?t=1733959893\" width=608 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159860/extras/c797fa8882eadd5f0d81d5e7f964ac32.webm?t=1733959893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159860/extras/c797fa8882eadd5f0d81d5e7f964ac32.mp4?t=1733959893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A FULLY WOOLY WORLD</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-arcade meets cozy gaming in Feltopia, a stop-motion side-scroller made entirely out of wool. You are Skyrider, a magical sheep herder on a quest to protect their rainbow flock from an infectious Smog Spirit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND AND PROTECT YOUR FLOCK!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More sheep = more powers! They've been scattered across the vast world of Feltopia and infected by smog. Transform them and keep them safe by gathering them into a cozy bundle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> CAST SPELLS &amp; WATCH THE WORLD TRANSFORM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your rainbow magic to heal the infected beings of Feltopia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159860/extras/2cb38adb6c0f52a20f1cac61f68eff0c.poster.avif?t=1733959893\" width=608 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159860/extras/2cb38adb6c0f52a20f1cac61f68eff0c.webm?t=1733959893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159860/extras/2cb38adb6c0f52a20f1cac61f68eff0c.mp4?t=1733959893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BATTLE &amp; HEAL BOSSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Guardians of the Realms have been deeply affected by the infectious smog. Solve simple puzzles and wield your growing powers to restore them to their true forms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159860/extras/8a4bb9cc2b4665f65c3b2efe9daa527d.avif?t=1733959893\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> <strong>The future of Feltopia depends on you....</strong> <br>   <br>  <strong>WARNING: Playing FELTOPIA may result in fuzzy feelings.</strong>   <br>   </h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159860/extras/c797fa8882eadd5f0d81d5e7f964ac32.poster.avif?t=1733959893\" width=608 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159860/extras/c797fa8882eadd5f0d81d5e7f964ac32.webm?t=1733959893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159860/extras/c797fa8882eadd5f0d81d5e7f964ac32.mp4?t=1733959893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A FULLY WOOLY WORLD</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-arcade meets cozy gaming in Feltopia, a stop-motion side-scroller made entirely out of wool. You are Skyrider, a magical sheep herder on a quest to protect their rainbow flock from an infectious Smog Spirit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND AND PROTECT YOUR FLOCK!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More sheep = more powers! They've been scattered across the vast world of Feltopia and infected by smog. Transform them and keep them safe by gathering them into a cozy bundle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> CAST SPELLS &amp; WATCH THE WORLD TRANSFORM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your rainbow magic to heal the infected beings of Feltopia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159860/extras/2cb38adb6c0f52a20f1cac61f68eff0c.poster.avif?t=1733959893\" width=608 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159860/extras/2cb38adb6c0f52a20f1cac61f68eff0c.webm?t=1733959893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159860/extras/2cb38adb6c0f52a20f1cac61f68eff0c.mp4?t=1733959893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BATTLE &amp; HEAL BOSSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Guardians of the Realms have been deeply affected by the infectious smog. Solve simple puzzles and wield your growing powers to restore them to their true forms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159860/extras/8a4bb9cc2b4665f65c3b2efe9daa527d.avif?t=1733959893\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> <strong>The future of Feltopia depends on you....</strong> <br>   <br>  <strong>WARNING: Playing FELTOPIA may result in fuzzy feelings.</strong>   <br>   </h2>",
    "short_description": "In this hand-felted, stop-motion &quot;cute-em-up,&quot; the realms of Feltopia have been infected by a mysterious Smog Spirit. Skyrider flies on their pegasus through wondrous landscapes to save their magical sheep, transform creatures, and battle bosses on their quest to uncover Feltopia\u2019s secrets.",
